{
  "$comment": "Relay model library grouping. Family = cached Server by-model family (serverFamilies, keyed by exact model id here) else RelayFamilyHeuristics (family-fixtures.json); nil -> retry with the segment after the last '/' (relays often prefix vendor, e.g. anthropic/claude-x); still nil -> group 'other'. The key-binding family is unchanged. Groups ordered by first appearance in catalog order, 'other' always last; rows keep catalog order. Label: labels table (proper nouns, not localized); family id missing from the table -> the id itself; 'other' (label null) -> localized 'Other'. Groups start collapsed. One function feeds setup step 2 and the library. Case id is used as RD3-GROUP-<id> in all ends.",
